ACADEMIC USE

If you use this software, or data produced with it, in a publication,
presentation or poster, please cite it. See CITATION.cff and the "How to
cite" section of README.md for the preferred citation.

Report the version number shown in the tool and in every export
(field `tool_version`), so that counts from different centres can be
compared.

